  "description": "C1Log is a modern, thread-safe, and highly configurable logging library for .NET applications.\nIt supports asynchronous logging, log file rolling (by date and size), minimum log level filtering, and custom log sinks for advanced scenarios.\nC1Log is easy to integrate, with flexible configuration via static properties or a configuration object, and supports syslog-style log levels with both full and shorthand names.",
